{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38953","headline":"乱後宿南陵废寺寄沈明府 · 杜荀鹤","name":"乱後宿南陵废寺寄沈明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祗共寒灯坐到明，塞鸿冲雪一声声。\n乱时爲客无人识，废寺吟诗有鬼惊。\n且把酒杯添志气，已将身事托公卿。\n男儿仗劒酬恩在，未肯徒然过一生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}